        <div class="bg-slate-900 p-3 rounded-xl max-w-[85%] text-slate-300">Arey bhai! HopWeb me chal raha hai. Model select karo aur message bhejo!</div>
    </div>

    <form id="chatForm" class="flex gap-2 bg-slate-900 p-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
